      "title": "What Is a Verified Cash App Account and Why Does It Matter?",
      "excerpt": "A complete educational guide explaining what Cash App verification means, how it works, why verified accounts have higher limits and features, and who benefits from having a fully verified Cash App profile.",
      "date": "June 6, 2026",
